Package: readAOFM
Title: Read and Tidy Australian Office of Financial Management Data
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R:
    person(given = "joelf01", email = "63056891+joelf01@users.noreply.github.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Downloads, imports, and tidies time-series workbooks published
    by the Australian Office of Financial Management (AOFM) Data Hub
    <https://www.aofm.gov.au/data-hub>.
    Provides a consistent interface to search the local catalogue, retrieve
    source workbooks, and parse Australian Government Securities issuance,
    transaction, position, ownership, turnover, and term-premium data into
    long-form data frames or named lists.
